, "", "", "", "二次元，动漫, The image captures an expansive desert landscape, dominated by endless golden sand dunes, illuminated by a warm, hazy sunlight. The dunes vary in size and shape, undulating across the scene in soft, sweeping curves. A watchtower stands prominently in the foreground, perched on an elevated dune. The wooden tower has a basic, squared structure with a platform roof and railing, possibly used for surveillance or observation. The faint presence of tire tracks and scattered vegetation, with tufts of grass and sparse bushes, suggests traces of human or vehicular activity in the otherwise barren environment."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "action"}, "name": "action", "label": "action", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "action"}, {"widget": {"name": "tidy_tags"}, "name": "tidy_tags", "label": "tidy_tags", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "tidy_tags"}, {"widget": {"name": "text_a"}, "shape": 7, "name": "text_a", "link": 81, "label": "text_a", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text_a"}, {"widget": {"name": "text_b"}, "shape": 7, "name": "text_b", "link": 59, "label": "text_b", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text_b"}, {"widget": {"name": "text_c"}, "shape": 7, "name": "text_c", "label": "text_c", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text_c"}], "flags": {}, "type": "StringFunction|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [400, 288.9974060058594], "pos": [-790.4091796875, 1095.9881591796875], "id": 43, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "aac13aa7ce35b07d43633c3bbe654a38c00d74f5", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"tidy_tags": true, "text_a": true, "text_c": true, "action": true, "text_b": true}, "Node name for S&R": "StringFunction|pysssss"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [59, 133], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [284.2447814941406, 113.80208587646484], "pos": [-426.541259765625, 808.6617431640625], "widgets_values": ["The image captures an expansive desert landscape, dominated by endless golden sand dunes, illuminated by a warm, hazy sunlight. The dunes vary in size and shape, undulating across the scene in soft, sweeping curves. A watchtower stands prominently in the foreground, perched on an elevated dune. The wooden tower has a basic, squared structure with a platform roof and railing, possibly used for surveillance or observation. The faint presence of tire tracks and scattered vegetation, with tufts of grass and sparse bushes, suggests traces of human or vehicular activity in the otherwise barren environment."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 27, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 25, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "b6deb5f5155fd400b20cce7f8644a61efdcbe098", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [98], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-979.69384765625, 812.5692138671875], "widgets_values": ["# FLUX prompt 助理\n\n你来充当一位有艺术气息的FLUX prompt 助理。\n\n## 任务\n\n我用自然语言告诉你要生成的prompt的主题，你的任务是根据这个主题想象一幅完整的画面，然后生成详细的prompt，包含具体的描述、场景、情感和风格等元素，让FLUX可以生成高质量的图像。\n\n## 背景介绍\n\nFLUX是一款利用深度学习的文生图模型，支持通过使用 自然语言 prompt 来产生新的图像，描述要包含或省略的元素。\n\n## Prompt 格式要求\n\n下面我将说明 prompt 的生成步骤，这里的 prompt 可用于描述人物、风景、物体或抽象数字艺术图画。你可以根据需要添加合理的、但不少于5处的画面细节。\n\n**示例：**\n\n- **输入主题**：A dragon soaring above a mountain range.\n  - **生成提示词**：A majestic, emerald-scaled dragon with glowing amber eyes, wings outstretched, soars through a breathtaking vista of snow-capped mountains. The dragon's powerful form dominates the scene, casting a long shadow over the imposing peaks. Below, a cascading waterfall plunges into a deep valley, its spray catching the sunlight in a dazzling array of colors. The dragon's scales shimmer with iridescent hues, reflecting the surrounding natural beauty. The sky is a vibrant blue, dotted with fluffy white clouds, creating a sense of awe and wonder. This dynamic and visually stunning depiction captures the majesty of both the dragon and the mountainous landscape.\n\n- **输入主题**：Explain the process of making a cup of tea.\n  - **生成提示词**：A detailed infographic depicting the step-by-step process of making a cup of tea. The infographic should be visually appealing with clear illustrations and concise text. It should start with a kettle filled with water and end with a steaming cup of tea, highlighting steps like heating the water, selecting tea leaves, brewing the tea, and enjoying the final product. The infographic should be designed to be informative and engaging, with a color scheme that complements the theme of tea. The text should be legible and informative, explaining each step in the process clearly and concisely.\n\n**指导**：\n\n1. **描述细节**：尽量提供具体的细节，如颜色、形状、位置等。\n2. **情感和氛围**：描述场景的情感和氛围，如温暖、神秘、宁静等。\n3. **风格和背景**：说明场景的风格和背景，如卡通风格、未来主义、复古等。\n\n### 3. 限制：\n- 我给你的主题可能是用中文描述，你给出的prompt只用中文。\n- 不要解释你的prompt，直接输出prompt。\n- 不要输出其他任何非prompt字符，只输出prompt，也不要包含 **生成提示词**： 等类似的字符。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 44, "type": "Text Multiline", "properties": {"cnr_id": "was-node-suite-comfyui", "ver": "ea935d1044ae5a26efa54ebeb18fe9020af49a45", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "positive", "links": [27], "label": "positive", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "positive"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["The image captures an expansive desert landscape, dominated by endless golden sand dunes, illuminated by a warm, hazy sunlight. The dunes vary in size and shape, undulating across the scene in soft, sweeping curves. A watchtower stands prominently in the foreground, perched on an elevated dune. The wooden tower has a basic, squared structure with a platform roof and railing, possibly used for surveillance or observation. The faint presence of tire tracks and scattered vegetation, with tufts of grass and sparse bushes, suggests traces of human or vehicular activity in the otherwise barren environment."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "positive"}, "name": "positive", "label": "positive", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "positive"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy positive", "title": "输入=当前镜头-提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [515.2994995117188, 176.1328125], "pos": [-259.092041015625, 104.98153686523438], "id": 21, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "50ae13a9935d71c7bb28330cd1f71633526aebfc", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"positive": true}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"positive": true}, "Node name for S&R": "easy positive"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "*", "links": [], "label": "*", "type": "*"}], "size": [210, 62.99479293823242], "pos": [-80.95110321044922, 1939.767578125], "widgets_values": ["提示词推理"], "inputs": [{"name": "STRING", "link": 25, "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "id": 19, "type": "SetNode", "title": "Set_STRING", "properties": {"previousName": "提示词推理", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "aux_id": "kijai/ComfyUI-KJNodes", "Node name for S&R": "SetNode"}, "order": 29}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [25, 87], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["append", "yes", "", "", "", "二次元，动漫, 动漫风格，超广角镜头，展现一片广阔无垠的沙漠景观。金黄色的沙丘连绵起伏，线条柔和流畅，在温暖朦胧的夕阳余晖下呈现出细腻的颗粒质感与梦幻的光晕。前景中，一座质朴的方形木制瞭望塔矗立在最高的沙丘顶端，塔身由风化的原木搭建，顶部设有带护栏的平台，木质纹理清晰可见，透出一丝荒凉与坚守的气息。塔下沙地上留有淡淡的轮胎印迹，蜿蜒延伸至远方，暗示着过往的足迹。稀疏的枯黄草丛与低矮灌木零星点缀在沙丘边缘，随风微微摇曳。天空呈现出渐变的暖橙色与淡紫色，云层轻薄如纱，营造出一种静谧、孤独却又充满史诗感的氛围。画面色彩饱和度高，光影对比强烈，具有典型的新海诚式或吉卜力工作室的唯美画风，细节丰富，构图宏大，让人感受到大自然的壮美与生命的渺小。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "action"}, "name": "action", "label": "action", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "action"}, {"widget": {"name": "tidy_tags"}, "name": "tidy_tags", "label": "tidy_tags", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "tidy_tags"}, {"widget": {"name": "text_a"}, "shape": 7, "name": "text_a", "link": 67, "label": "text_a", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text_a"}, {"widget": {"name": "text_b"}, "shape": 7, "name": "text_b", "link": 135, "label": "text_b", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text_b"}, {"widget": {"name": "text_c"}, "shape": 7, "name": "text_c", "label": "text_c", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text_c"}], "flags": {}, "type": "StringFunction|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [372.9961242675781, 377.6127014160156], "pos": [-168.7626495361328, 1113.8338623046875], "id": 23, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "aac13aa7ce35b07d43633c3bbe654a38c00d74f5", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"tidy_tags": true, "text_a": true, "text_c": true, "action": true, "text_b": true}, "Node name for S&R": "StringFunction|pysssss"}, "order": 27}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "size": [270, 150], "pos": [-94.19963073730469, 1641.812744140625], "widgets_values": ["output/软件/文本", "文本", "txt", true], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 87, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "output_file_path"}, "name": "output_file_path", "label": "output_file_pat